    "name": "symbolic-decay_F_to_FpV",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Tree-level two-body width of a heavy Dirac fermion into a lighter\nfermion plus a massive vector (the t->bW archetype): (a) pure vector\ncoupling, (b) general chiral coupling L = fbar gamma^mu(gL PL + gR PR) F\nV_mu + h.c. The massive-vector polarization sum (with its longitudinal\np^mu p^nu/m_V^2 piece) is the content. Exact numeric widths (GeV) +\nclosed-form formulas in results/answer.json. Ground truth derived and\nverified in ground_truth/derivation.py (reduces to the textbook t->bW\nwidth; conventions in ../CONVENTIONS.md).\n",
